WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Start the terminal UI with mtp tui.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Read slash commands with /help.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
Choose a provider with /backend.

00:09.000 --> 00:12.000
Enter credentials in the masked /apikey groq setup form.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.000
Ctrl+N creates another chat with its own draft.

00:15.000 --> 00:20.000
Inspect the active session and workspace with /status.
